docs {
  Updates college onboarding/profile data.

  Notes:
  - Send tab data under `profileSections`.
  - Keep list-like fields as arrays even for one item.
    Examples: `aminities`, `nearby_access.transit`, `campus_reels`,
    `courseAccolades`, `grading_scale`, `ratingDistribution`,
    `libraryHours`, `alliance.items`.
}
